    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way down the mountain by walking, jumping, and falling through a series of strange worlds, cultures, media, and other nouns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Down You Go</strong> is a challenging platformer about an obese man attempting to get off of a mountain top. He can only walk, jump, and on occasion, bunny hop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whilst you descend, enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ever-changing environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You will fall through the culture of Japan, the junk food of America, and other nouns.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hours of gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Between 5 and 500 hours of gameplay.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No enemies. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just gravity, and your many mistakes.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>400 pounds of pure athleticism</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Makes falling easier.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Move, jump, regret.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely non-violent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Other than what it may compel you to do.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876910/extras/fae831f1e0a5513bc98c10b35c333057.poster.avif?t=1754647880\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876910/extras/fae831f1e0a5513bc98c10b35c333057.webm?t=1754647880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876910/extras/fae831f1e0a5513bc98c10b35c333057.mp4?t=1754647880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
